&= (y + 1)((y + 1)(y + 1) - y^2) - y(y(y + 1) - y^2) + y(y^2 - y(y + 1)) \\
&= \boxed{3y + 1}.
\end{align*}

Let $\mathbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} x \\ y \end{pmatrix}.$

